{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 53454, "name": "Ben Cotton", "username": "bcotton", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/bcotton/{size}/28189_2.png", "created_at": "2021-10-01T22:24:45.127Z", "cooked": "<p><small>Originally published at:\t\t\t<a href=\"https://communityblog.fedoraproject.org/fridays-fedora-facts-2021-39/\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Friday's Fedora Facts: 2021-39 – Fedora Community Blog</a><br>\n</small><br></p><p>Here’s your weekly Fedora report. Read what happened this week and what’s coming up. Your contributions are welcome (see the end of the post)!</p><p></p>\n<p>Fedora Linux 35 Beta was released! Final freeze begins Tuesday.</p>\n<p>I have weekly office hours on Wednesdays in the morning and afternoon (US/Eastern time) in #fedora-meeting-1. Drop by if you have any questions or comments about the schedule, Changes, elections, or anything else. See the <a href=\"#upcoming-meetings\">upcoming meetings</a> for more information.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#announcements\">Announcements</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#cfps\">Calls for Participation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#help-wanted\">Help wanted</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#upcoming-meetings\">Upcoming meetings</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#releases\">Releases</a></li>\n</ul><h2>Announcements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/reminder-summer-time-changes-coming-up/27831/2\">Summer time is changing</a> in various locations.</li>\n<li>Registration is open for the <a href=\"https://hopin.com/events/fedora-linux-35-release-party/registration\">F35 Release Party</a>.</li>\n<li>Fedora Week of Diversity is next week!</li>\n</ul><h3>CfPs</h3>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Conference</th>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th>Date</th>\n<th>CfP</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://olfconference.org/\">Ohio Linux Fest</a></td>\n<td>Columbus, OH, US</td>\n<td>early Dec</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://olfconference.org/call-for-presentations/\">closes 1 Oct</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.devconf.info/cz/\">DevConf.CZ</a></td>\n<td>Brno, CZ &amp; virtual</td>\n<td>28–29 Jan</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://cfp.devconf.info/\">closes 24 Oct</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/19x\">SCaLE</a></td>\n<td>Pasadena, CA, US</td>\n<td>5–8 Mar</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/19x/cfp\">closes 30 Nov</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>Help wanted</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>288 <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/PackageReviewStatus/\">package review requests</a> are awaiting a reviewer</li>\n<li>\n<a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/VHQN5VB2R3B7IKLM7QEII27YACAVNDJN/\">Orphaned packages</a> seeking maintainers</li>\n</ul><h2>Prioritized Bugs</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/program_management/prioritized_bugs/\">Prioritized Bugs documentation</a> for information on the process, including how to nominate bugs.</p>\n<h2>Upcoming meetings</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Blocker review meeting — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/10066\">1600 UTC Monday</a> in #fedora-blocker-review</li>\n<li>FPgM Office Hours — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9527/\">1300 UTC Wednesday</a> and <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9915/\">2000 UTC Wednesday</a> in #fedora-meeting-1</li>\n<li>Prioritized bugs meeting — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9964/\">1500 UTC Wednesday</a> in #fedora-meeting-1 </li>\n<li>Fedora Social Hour — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/9743/\">1400 UTC Thursday</a> in <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/#social:fedoraproject.org?web-instance%5Belement.io%5D=chat.fedoraproject.org\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">#social on Fedora.im</a> </li>\n<li>Fedora Council Video Meeting: Matrix — <a href=\"https://calendar.fedoraproject.org/meeting/10082/\">1600 UTC 14 October</a> on <a href=\"https://bluejeans.com/6567714215\">Bluejeans</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h2>Releases</h2>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Release</th>\n<th>open bugs</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>F33</td>\n<td>5168</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F34</td>\n<td>5013</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F35 (beta)</td>\n<td>1081</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F36 (rawhide)</td>\n<td>6085</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>Fedora Linux 35</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>204 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1927309\">fail to build from source</a>\n</li>\n<li>56 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1927313\">fail to install</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h4>Schedule</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-10-05</strong> — Final freeze begins</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-10-19</strong> — Early Final target date</li>\n<li>\n<strong>2021-10-22</strong> — Final target date #1</li>\n</ul><p>For the full schedule, see the <a href=\"https://fedorapeople.org/groups/schedule/f-35/f-35-key-tasks.html\">schedule website</a>.</p>\n<h4>Changes</h4>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Releases/35/ChangeSet\">ChangeSet page</a> or <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=F35Changes\">Bugzilla</a> for information on approved Changes.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>BZ Status</th>\n<th>Count</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>ASSIGNED</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MODIFIED</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ON_QA</td>\n<td>42</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h4>Blockers</h4>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Bug ID</th>\n<th>Component</th>\n<th>Bug Status</th>\n<th>Blocker Status</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1989726\">1989726</a></td>\n<td>mesa</td>\n<td>NEW</td>\n<td>Accepted (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1997315\">1997315</a></td>\n<td>abrt</td>\n<td>ASSIGNED</td>\n<td>Accepted (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1991075\">1991075</a></td>\n<td>geoclue</td>\n<td>NEW</td>\n<td>Accepted (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2006028\">2006028</a></td>\n<td>cockpit</td>\n<td>ON_QA</td>\n<td>Accepted (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2001837\">2001837</a></td>\n<td>selinux-policy</td>\n<td>ASSIGNED</td>\n<td>Accepted (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2006746\">2006746</a></td>\n<td>spice-vdagent</td>\n<td>NEW</td>\n<td>Proposed (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2006632\">2006632</a></td>\n<td>libreport</td>\n<td>ASSIGNED</td>\n<td>Proposed (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2006393\">2006393</a></td>\n<td>systemd</td>\n<td>NEW</td>\n<td>Proposed (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2009451\">2009451</a></td>\n<td>gnome-calendar</td>\n<td>NEW</td>\n<td>Proposed (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2009063\">2009063</a></td>\n<td>gnome-software</td>\n<td>NEW</td>\n<td>Proposed (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2009304\">2209304</a></td>\n<td>spice-vdagent</td>\n<td>NEW</td>\n<td>Proposed (Final)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h3>Fedora Linux 36</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>271 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992484\">fail to build from source</a>\n</li>\n<li>62 packages <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?bug_status=__open__&amp;f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=1992487\">fail to install</a>\n</li>\n</ul><h4>Changes</h4>\n<p>The table below lists proposed Changes. See the <a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Releases/36/ChangeSet\">ChangeSet page</a> or <a href=\"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/buglist.cgi?f1=blocked&amp;list_id=11983255&amp;o1=substring&amp;query_format=advanced&amp;v1=F36Changes\">Bugzilla</a> for information on approved Changes.</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Proposal</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/ExcludeFromWeakAutodetect\">Enable exclude_from_weak_autodetect by default in LIBDNF</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://pagure.io/fesco/issue/2667\">FESCo #2667</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/php81\">PHP 8.1</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/GOOKSMYLBEAXZZDVOMLXFN5QF5TPURHL/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Setuptools_58%2B\">Setuptools 58+</a></td>\n<td>Self-Contained</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/N3QBIYZD5BHV7AHQGPPS3H6BFU35JRYC/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>Fedora Linux 37</h2>\n<p>The table below lists proposed Changes. </p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Proposal</th>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Python3.11\">Python 3.11</a></td>\n<td>System-Wide</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/devel-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/thread/AVUZDI7RCKQJCO7ADT3MBEJHEMGFL7HX/\">Announced</a></td>\n</tr></tbody>\n</table><h2>Contributing</h2>\n<p>Have something you want included? You can file an issue or submit 